Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "ConstructionZoneObstruction" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obs1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:obs1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Excavator machinery obstructing the lane" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle forced to navigate around unexpected road obstruction" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Lane intrusion risk due to construction machinery (excavator) occupying the active driving path.
Severity Score: 0.75